  m_text: "<size=21>- 3 or more SCATTERS trigger the PIXIES FREE SPIN BONUS.\n- Player
    will be awarded 8 free spins. For every free spin, Fairies will turn 1-4 reels
    wild on\n   reels 2-5.\n- Fairies also may randomly award a multiplier from 2-4.\n-
    Retrigger award 8 additional free spins.\n- Coins bet are the same as the game
    that triggered the Pixies Free Spin Bonus."
