  m_text: '<size=21>- All wins pay LEFT to RIGHT  on adjacent reels, beginning with
    leftmost reel, except scatters.

    - All wins are paid on lines played, except scatters, which are added to line
    wins.

    - Highest win paid on any played line, except scatters.

    - All wins are multiplied by the number of coins bet per line, except scatters.

'
